VIEWMODEL.md §3.6, TYPES.md §5.3, §7.2: a column width is an integer literal typed Int, so one that does not fit Int is E3201; a width that fits but is out of 16..2000 is views' (E1613).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A gem.
local record Gem {
  /// Its name.
  name: String
  /// Its weight.
  weight: Int
}

view Gem {
  columns { name 99999999999999999999, weight 5000 }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3201]  a/a.canon:12:18
  99999999999999999999 does not fit Int

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
